    text: "Review acceptance: exact-byte coverage pre-populates sandbox history/_workspace.jsonl with an initializer stream, seeds a distinct source stream through seedLinkedTestTrackerData, and proves the sandbox stream equals the source bytes. The production implementation already preserved existing source history; no runtime change was required. Focused suite passed 63/63 and full coverage passed 572 files / 7904 tests at exactly 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines."
  - created_at: "2026-08-25T08:01:21.390Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Merged delivery evidence: PR #1113 merged to main as 74632a9ceb246cabcdb37f52b943af2dd45c7a84. Exact-main CI run 32823719285 passed release-analyzer provenance, build, Windows Node 24, four coverage shards plus the exact aggregate gate, typecheck, compatibility, smokes, and static assurance. Exact-main CodeQL 32823719216, Security 32823719166, Docs 32823719193, OSSF 32823719210, and CodSpeed 32823719238 all passed. GitHub issue #1109 closed via the merged PR."
